  'Mehrere Firmen bearbeiten': 'Edit several companies',
  'Massenaktion für Firmen (IDs aus ghl_list_companies): owner (owner_id = Nutzer-ID oder leer), delete, enroll (die mit den Firmen verknüpften Kontakte in workflow_id aufnehmen). Jede Firma läuft über die normale Route; Fehler stehen je Firma in failed.': 'Bulk action for companies (IDs from ghl_list_companies): owner (owner_id = user ID or empty), delete, enroll (add the contacts linked to the companies to workflow_id). Each company goes through the normal route; errors are listed per company in failed.',
